Each day, continue your one chance at a Challenge Battle run for a maximum of 10 Victories or until you are defeated!

The longer your run of Victories continues, the more difficult the Manors you are invading will become.
After even one defeat, you will have to wait until the following day to take the Challenge again.

Earn more awesome rewards the longer your run continues!

:※ Your Victory count will be reset each day at 12:00am, and you will have to start from the beginning
:※ This game mode will have no effect on your Burgle Points total.
