==Past Versions==
===2021===
*'''1.5.8''' Mar 26th
- Burgle Battle rebalance, some fixes to Willpower.

*'''1.5.7''' In-game notice:
① '''Adjustments to Outfit Willpower parameters'''<br>
All Willpower values for Outfits have been increased.<br>
※ The degree of Willpower increase will vary based on the item's Rarity

'''② Adjustments to Trap Will Damage values'''<br>
Values of Will Damage caused by Traps has been increased.<br>
※ The degree of damage increase will vary based on the item's Rarity

'''③ Adjustments to Time Limits'''<br>
Willpower decrease rate in Burgle Battles & Ticket Heists has been slowed.<br>
Basically, this means that the time limit for all battles has been lengthened.

'''④ Adjustments to the Teamwork Miracle'''<br>
The increased Willpower bonus granted by the Miracle "Teamwork" is now smaller (From 5%/level to 2%/level)<br>
※ To balance the decreased bonus Willpower from Teamwork, please increase the level of your team's Outfits.

*'''1.5.4''' Feb 24th
- Opens the game to NA players.

- Added the feature to rebattle, the Manor owner's burgle points won't be affected regardless of the rebattle outcome.

